  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>활<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>히<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> 됴<ruby>호<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GPoTmtykcGY?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>海海<rt>해ˆ해ˋ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>需要<rt>수ˉᄋᆤˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>攏<rt>렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>了解<rt>ᄅᆤˆ개ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rin-siêng hâi-hài, kâm-sū-yàu-lông-liâu-kài\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˋ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>清醒<rt>촁ˉ칠ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>凊彩<rt>친ˋ채ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-si-à chiēng-chḭ̀, u-sí chìn-chài\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講好<rt>겅ˆ호ˋ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>一定<rt>읻ˆ뎽-</rt></ruby><ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>講<rt>겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>䆀<rt>빼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-láng kông-hò, ît-tieng-u-láng kông-bài\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>若<rt>나-</rt></ruby><ruby>매<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby>想<rt>슐-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"hiâh\">遐<rt>햫ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby><span style=\"font-family: Noto Sans SC\">㩼</span><rt>죄ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>란<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>生活<rt>솅ˉ왛ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>較<rt>캏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>自在<rt>주재ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    na-mài-siṵ-hiâh-joē, lân-siēng-oâh khâh-ju-jāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>規工<rt>귀ˉ강ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>嫌<rt>햠-</rt></ruby><ruby>車<rt>챠ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>夠<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>奅<rt>팔ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>嫌<rt>햠-</rt></ruby><ruby>厝<rt>추</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>夠<rt>ᄀᅷˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>大<rt>돠ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kūi-kâng hiam-chiâ bo-kàu-phā̰, hiam-chu bo-kàu-toā\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>嫌<rt>햠-</rt></ruby><ruby>菜<rt>채</rt></ruby> <ruby>煮<rt>주ˋ</rt></ruby>’<ruby>ᄅᆤ<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>食<rt>쟣ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>嫌<rt>햠-</rt></ruby><ruby>𡚸<rt>뻐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>傷<rt>슐ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>歹<rt>팰ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    hiam-chai jù’liàu bo-hô-jiâh, hiam-bòr siṵ̄-phâ̰i-khoa̰\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>駛<rt>새ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>著<rt>둏-</rt></ruby><ruby>好車<rt>호ˆ챠ˆ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>驚人偷<rt>걀ˉ랑ᄐᅷˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>大厝<rt>돠추</rt></ruby> <ruby>歹<rt>팰ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>摒掃<rt>뱔ˋᄉᅷ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sâi-tioh-hô-chiâ kiā̰-lang-thâu, toa-chu phâ̰i-pià̰-sau\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>食<rt>쟣-</rt></ruby><ruby>徦<rt>갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>傷<rt>슐ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>好<rt>호ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>驚<rt>걀ˉ-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>血壓高<rt>세야ˆᄀᅷˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>媠<rt>쉬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𡚸<rt>뻐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>綴人走<rt>뒈ˋ랑ᄌᅷˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiah-kâh-siṵ̄-hò kiā̰-se-yâ-kâu, sûi-bòr e-tuè-lang-jàu\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>人生<rt>띤솅ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>短短<rt>ᄃힻˆᄃힻˋ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>好<rt>호ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𨑨<rt>칟ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>迌<rt>토ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    rin-siêng têr-tèr, hô-chīn-chiṵ-lêh-chît-thó\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>仔<rt>아ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>煩惱<rt>환로ˋ</rt></ruby>, <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>輕可<rt>킨ˉ코ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    u-si-à hoan-lò, u-sí khīn-khò\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>問<rt>믕-</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>到底<rt>ᄃᅷˆ도ˋ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>腹內<rt>박ˆ래ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>有<rt>우-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>샬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>法寶<rt>홛ˆ보ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    mng-goà tâu-tò, pâk-lāi u-siâ̰-hoât-pò\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>其實<rt>기싣-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>撇步<r